{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26676","headline":"寄送卢拱秘书游魏州 · 姚合","name":"寄送卢拱秘书游魏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太行山下路，荆棘昨来平。\n一自开元後，今逢上客行。\n地形吞北虏，人事接东京。\n埽洒氛埃静，游从气概生。\n蓟门春不艳，淇水煖还清。\n看野风情远，寻花酒病成。\n官闲身自在，诗逸语纵横。\n车马回应晚，烟光满去程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}